# Born probabilities of a qudit GHZ state measured in the computational basis, symbolic in d:
# the first qudit of the 4-qudit GHZ state gives 0 with probability 1/d whatever the
# others give (they are discarded). The probability is the closed mixed diagram's CPM scalar;
# the target is the trace of |0><0| / d. Over the qudit count n, induct checks the schema at
# n = 0..3; the engine proves no symbolic-n statement here (docs/MIXED.txt, section 8).

@p =
  x = X(0 -> 1)
  x -> G
  scalar d^(-1)

load
  g = Z(0 -> 4)
  g.out0 -> X(1 -> 0)
  g.out1 -> G
  g.out2 -> G
  g.out3 -> G
  scalar d^(-1)
decide against @p

load
  count n
  g = Z(0 -> 3)
  g.out0 -> X(1 -> 0)
  g.out1 -> G
  repeat n: g.out2 -> G
  scalar d^(-1)
induct on n d=3 against @p
